  CiIdentity array parameter used to report the identity and configuration information of the remote unit: Index 1: Remote unit type Index 2: Remote unit subtype Index 3: Ci engine version Index 4: APP FPGA version Index 5: Number of discrete inputs Index 6: Number of discrete outputs Index 7: Number of isolated discrete outputs Index 8: Number of analog inputs Index 9: Number of analog outputs Index 10: Maximum continuous current Index 11: Maximum peak current Index 12: Minimum VBus Index 13: Maximum VBus Index 14: Center PWM Index 15: APP FPGA major version Index 16: APP FPGA minor version Index 17: APP FPGA patch version Index 18: APP FPGA owner Index 19: APP FPGA override Index 20: COMM version Index 21: Amplifier version Index 22: FPGA size Index 23: Amplifier variant Indices 24..39: Remote FPGA FEATURES words 0..15 Index 40: Feature availability (0 pending, 1 valid, 2 absent, 3 invalid, 4 transport error) Index 41: Feature snapshot generation; bracket multi-message reads with generation and availability
