- property System.Double LockValBefMap { get; }
  Lock value before error mapping, read-only. The same capture as LockVal, latched on the same lock edge, but taken before error compensation: the map table, MapErrOffset and the MapType on/off ramp are all excluded, as in PosBeforeMap. It is in the same space as EventPos and, like LockVal, in user units. It is held at the product's full position width: 64-bit on the AGM800 and AGM800-EC (inside ±2^51 counts, which a double holds exactly), where LockVal stays 32-bit. On those products LockVal - LockValBefMap equals the map correction only modulo 2^32. Only firmware that reports the LockValBefMap keyword carries it; on older firmware a read throws ControllerCommandException.
- property AAMotion.AAValueArray<System.Double> LockValTabB { get; }
