  Motor type, readable and writable. The optional values are as follows: 0: Unknown 1: DC brush motor 2: Voice coil motor 3: Linear DC brushless 4: Rotary DC brushless 5: Simulation Choosing the wrong motor type may cause damage to the equipment. Please set it up carefully.
