- property System.Double PosPosTh { get; set; }
  Position to trigger automatic switch to position mode (default is force control), readable and writable.
- property System.Double PosRef { get; }
  PosRef returns the position reference generated by the internal profiler in user units (UsrUnits). The value of PosRef is fed to the position control loop. The value is a double and carries any User-Units scaling AAComm applied to the reply.
- property System.Double PreCruAbsTrgt { get; set; }
  PreCruAbsTrgt is the absolute position at which the cruise phase of a Sine PTP motion begins, readable and writable. It applies only while the pre-cruise phase is enabled (PreCruiseSpd is non-zero) and PreCruRelTrgt is 0, and it must point in the same direction as AbsTrgt.
