  PreCruRelTrgt is the distance from the starting position at which the cruise phase of a Sine PTP motion begins, readable and writable. A non-zero value overrides PreCruAbsTrgt, and it must carry the same sign as RelTrgt.
- property System.Double PreCruiseSpd { get; set; }
  PreCruiseSpd is the maximum speed of the Sine PTP pre-cruise phase, readable and writable. 0 disables the pre-cruise phase; any non-zero value enables it. A value below Speed is raised to Speed by the controller without an error.
