Struct aamotion_sine_ptp_config (aamotion.h; AAMotion C): ====================================== Sine PTP motion ====================================== A point-to-point move with a sine-shaped (jerk-limited) profile, MotionMode 20 single or 21 reciprocating, optionally with a pre-cruise phase. The whole parameter set is written on every call. One complete Sine PTP motion. motionMode is AAMOTION_MOTION_MODE_SINE_PTP or AAMOTION_MOTION_MODE_SINE_PTPREPEAT (ignored by aamotion_sine_ptp_commit). A non-zero relTrgt overrides absTrgt. The pre-cruise phase exists only while preCruiseSpd is non-zero; its target must lie in the direction of the main target and short of it.
Signature: typedef struct aamotion_sine_ptp_config

Declaration:
typedef struct aamotion_sine_ptp_config {
    int    motionMode;
    double relTrgt;
    double absTrgt;
    double speed;
    double accel;
    double decel;
    double jerkInAcc;
    double jerkInDec;
    double preCruRelTrgt;
    double preCruAbsTrgt;
    double preCruiseSpd;
} aamotion_sine_ptp_config;

Struct aamotion_gear_config (aamotion.h; AAMotion C): ================================== Electronic gearing ================================== The axis follows a master parameter multiplied by ratioNumerator / ratioDenominator. Stop it with aamotion_stop. One gearing motion. master: the parameter followed, named with its axis prefix: "BPos" (B's encoder), "APosRef" (A's position command), "AAuxPos". Required. ratioNumerator, ratioDenominator: the ratio (MasterFact / MasterFactDen); 65536 / 65536 is 1:1. Firmware without MasterFactDen divides by 65536 and takes only 65536 as the denominator. filter: input filter in 64ths (MasterFilt), 1..64; 64 passes the geared master unfiltered, a smaller value filters more slowly. Direct gearing only. masterModRev: the master's own ModRev when it has one, 0 for none. motionMode: AAMOTION_MOTION_MODE_GEAR_DIRECT (5), where the geared master is the position command, or AAMOTION_MOTION_MODE_GEAR_INDIRECT (6), where it is the profiler's target, limited by the axis's speed, acceleration, deceleration and jerk.
Signature: typedef struct aamotion_gear_config

Declaration:
typedef struct aamotion_gear_config {
    const char* master;
    int ratioNumerator;
    int ratioDenominator;
    int filter;
    int masterModRev;
    int motionMode;
} aamotion_gear_config;

