Enum aamotion_connection_probe_failure_t (aamotion_enums.h; AAMotion C): Why ProbeConnection did not get a numeric reply. Reported by aamotion_probe_connection; NONE when the controller answered. Mirrors the C# AAMotion.ConnectionProbeFailure.
Signature: typedef enum aamotion_connection_probe_failure_t

Declaration:
typedef enum {
    /// The controller answered.
    AAMOTION_CONNECTION_PROBE_FAILURE_NONE = 0,
    /// The link was down before the probe, so nothing was sent, or it was torn down while the probe
    /// waited, by something other than the probe's own timeout.
    AAMOTION_CONNECTION_PROBE_FAILURE_NOT_CONNECTED = 1,
    /// No reply within the timeout. Like any command timeout, one that reached the controller tears
    /// the connection down; one that expired still queued behind other commands was never sent and
    /// leaves it up.
    AAMOTION_CONNECTION_PROBE_FAILURE_TIMEOUT = 2,
    /// The reply is an error: the controller's ERR , or one the SDK reported for the command.
    AAMOTION_CONNECTION_PROBE_FAILURE_CONTROLLER_ERROR = 3,
    /// The reply is not a number.
    AAMOTION_CONNECTION_PROBE_FAILURE_INVALID_REPLY = 4
} aamotion_connection_probe_failure_t;

Enum aamotion_controller_error_source_t (aamotion_enums.h; AAMotion C): Where a reported error came from. Passed to an aamotion_error_reported_cb. Mirrors the C# AAMotion.ControllerErrorSource.
Signature: typedef enum aamotion_controller_error_source_t

Declaration:
typedef enum {
    /// A call into AAMotion on one of the application's own threads.
    AAMOTION_CONTROLLER_ERROR_SOURCE_API = 0,
    /// A check AAMotion made before sending anything, such as an argument it refused; Command then
    /// names the method, not a controller command.
    AAMOTION_CONTROLLER_ERROR_SOURCE_CLIENT_CHECK = 1,
    /// The fast read cache's background refresh (FastReadEnabled).
    AAMOTION_CONTROLLER_ERROR_SOURCE_FAST_READ_REFRESH = 2,
    /// The fast read cache's background InTargetStat read that follows a motion after Begin .
    AAMOTION_CONTROLLER_ERROR_SOURCE_IN_TARGET_STAT_POLL = 3
} aamotion_controller_error_source_t;

Function family aamotion_is (aamotion.h; AAMotion C).
Signature: aamotion_is*

Functions:
- bool aamotion_is_connected(aamotion_controller controller)
  The comm layer's own logical connection state: no ping, no reconnect, safe to poll. It does not prove the controller is reachable (a pulled cable can leave the link logically open); aamotion_check_connection and aamotion_probe_connection do.
- bool aamotion_is_auto_phase(aamotion_controller controller, int axis)
  @return true when auto-phasing has completed.
- bool aamotion_is_commutated(aamotion_controller controller, int axis)
  @return true when commutation is complete (ComtStatus[1] reads 100, 200, 300, 400 or 500).
- bool aamotion_is_cnc_completed(aamotion_controller controller, int axis)
  @return true when the CNC motion has completed.
- bool aamotion_is_homed(aamotion_controller controller, int axis)
  @return true when the axis has completed homing.
